        <p class="contact-description">
          I'm looking for opportunities in robotics engineering, autonomous systems,
          embedded systems, and robotics R&D. Open to positions at robotics companies,
          research labs, and engineering teams worldwide.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-links">
        <a href="mailto:naveensg.rbb2226@saintgits.org" class="contact-link-card">
          <span class="contact-link-icon">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="contact-link-label mono">Email</span>
          <span class="contact-link-value">naveensg.rbb2226@saintgits.org</span>
        </a>

        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/naveen-shaji-george-a55b55243" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="contact-link-card">
          <span class="contact-link-icon">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"/><rect x="2" y="9" width="4" height="12"/><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="contact-link-label mono">LinkedIn</span>
          <span class="contact-link-value">Naveen Shaji George</span>
        </a>

        <a href="https://github.com/buddytex" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="contact-link-card">
          <span class="contact-link-icon">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"/>
